        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: CityJet, Air France, KLM, Brussels Airlines, Scandinavian Airlines\n- Places: Montparnasse, Paris, Charles de Gaulle Airport\n- Topics: wet-lease agreements, corporate headquarters\n\nFacts:\n- CityJet serves several additional destinations under wet-lease agreements with Air France, KLM, Brussels Airlines, and Scandinavian Airlines.\n- CityJet's wet-lease agreement with Air France ends on 31 October 2017.\n- Air France's corporate headquarters were previously in Montparnasse, Paris.\n- Air France's corporate headquarters are located on the grounds of Charles de Gaulle Airport, north of Paris.",
